cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "KSFeatureSelector: Kolmogorov-Smirnov feature selection for scikit-learn"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Parupudi"
    given-names: "V Subrahmanya Raghu Ram Kishore"
    email: pvsrrkishore@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/NikolaTesla-007/ksfeatureselector"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/ksfeatureselector/"
abstract: >-
  A scikit-learn compatible feature selector that ranks features by their
  ability to separate the classes of a binary or multi-class target using the
  two-sample Kolmogorov-Smirnov (K-S) test, with pairwise and one-vs-rest
  comparison strategies and Fisher, min, and max p-value aggregation.
keywords:
  - feature selection
  - scikit-learn
  - kolmogorov-smirnov
  - machine learning
  - statistics
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-06-03"
